pdfexpand.tex (with pdfexpand.dat), pdfrandom.tex: oracle .log made by `pdftex -ini -etex -interaction=batchmode core.tex` (pdfTeX 1.40.29, SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH=1 FORCE_SOURCE_DATE=1), core.tex being tests/pdftex.rs's prelude, the fixture and `\end`; the log from `(./core.tex` to the last ` )`.

ttf.tex (Arvo, TrueType), ownpdf0.tex (font replacement), png.tex, png8.tex, jpeg.tex, ownpdf.tex, linkbreak.tex, outlinetree.tex, csform.tex, objstm2.tex, tounicode2.tex (with png-*.png, small PNGs of each colour type written by hand): goldens for phitex-pdf, `pdftex -ini -interaction=batchmode <name>.tex` (pdfTeX 1.40.29) in this directory with SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH=0 FORCE_SOURCE_DATE=1.

imgloop.tex (with png-gray.png): oracle .log made by `pdftex -ini -interaction=batchmode imgloop.tex` (pdfTeX 1.40.29) in this directory with SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH=0 FORCE_SOURCE_DATE=1: `\pdflastximage` after pages fired at paragraphs' starts.

nomap10.tfm: cmr10.tfm under a name no map file has an entry for, for tests/pdftex.rs's font_without_map_entry_is_fatal (no oracle output: `pdftex -ini` ends on `Font nomap10 at 72 not found`, a fatal error, with no PDF file).
